{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Zodiac Requiem&quot; is a top-down shooter RPG based on the Chinese zodiac. You play as Lin Xiaoman, a mysterious girl who embarks on a perilous journey through thorns and trials to uncover the truth about her origins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: The Demo is only available for the first two chapters, namely the Zishu and Chouniu levels, and corresponding weapons can also be obtained</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zodiac Requiem</i> features a <strong>top-down perspective</strong> with a <strong>mini-map UI</strong>, allowing players to clearly track their surroundings and enemy movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887730/extras/2693b9415d41af816726929c5ee43ae0.avif?t=1760054158\" width=1000 height=547 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps are <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, ensuring unique exploration experiences even in repeated areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887730/extras/b506d02320a8224a99eafdab729adc3a.avif?t=1760054158\" width=616 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop <strong>weapons of varying rarities and affixes</strong>, with 12 major weapon classes (rifles, sniper rifles, pistols, etc.) and detailed subclass customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887730/extras/9dc30808dbcf71ff7e98fc8eb74ae145.avif?t=1760054158\" width=616 height=992 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge 12 <strong>Zodiac-themed final bosses</strong> \u2013 experiment with weapon builds to conquer these <strong>Souls-like difficulty encounters</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 